<title>USA: PLC Systems says FDA panel to meet July 28.</title>
<headline>PLC Systems says FDA panel to meet July 28.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKLIN, Mass. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>PLC Systems Inc said Monday it had been informed that a Food and Drug Administration advisory panel had scheduled a July 28-29 meeting to review circulatory system devices.</p>
<p>The company said an FDA reviewer told it the meeting would include review of the Heart Laser TMR System developed by its subsidary PLC Medical Systems Inc.</p>
<p>(( New York Newsdesk, 212 859-1610))</p>
